name issue_76_packetization_v2
describe Video payloads sized from the real header as libwebrtc's RtpSenderVideo, 1200-byte packets (#76 group 7)
# Group 7 is parity-only: the call must hold up with libwebrtc's packet capacity.
# Target (#76): no metric worse than `packetization v1` on this link.
seed 1
packetization v2
duration 20s
at 0s capacity=3000kbps delay=40ms jitter=10ms loss=1% queue=200ms
reverse at 0s delay=40ms
expect video.longest_freeze_ms < 2500
expect video.residual_loss_pct < 1
expect audio.concealed_pct < 4
